invalid type: string "Command: tar\nTitle: E[x]tract files matching a pattern from an archive [f]ile\nUsage: tar xf path/to/source.tar --wildcards \"*.html\"\nTemplate: tar xf {{path/to/source.tar}} --wildcards \"{{*.html}}\"\nDescription: Archiving utility. Often combined with a compression method, such as `gzip` or `bzip2`. More information: <https://www.gnu.org/software/tar/manual/tar.html>."ÿÿ